Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 06:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?power:=20supply:=20huawei-gaokun-battery:=20dec?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ode=200x82=20by=20bits,=20report=20CAPACITY=5FLEVEL=EF=BC=88?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E6=9C=AC=E5=9C=B0=EF=BC=8C1.0=20=E6=89=B9=202=20BATT-1/2/3?=
